  ($$Ursa Major$$, $$Essential Face Tonic$$, $$A hydrating, refreshing tonic with witch hazel and aloe that gently smooths texture. Scented with essential oils.$$, ARRAY[$$Aloe$$, $$Witch hazel$$, $$Sugarcane extract$$], $$Sweep over clean skin with a cotton pad, morning and night.$$, $$4 oz$$),
